The doorbell rings.
I open the door with a smile.
Kasper and Sara are standing outside.
They smile and wave at me.
"Hi Maya, and thank you very much for the invitation!" Kasper says happily.
"Hi!"
"Come inside," I answer.
"It smells amazing already," Sara says.
"Take your jackets off first," I tell them.
I take their jackets and hang them up in the hallway.
Afterwards, Sara gives me a bag.
"We brought some cold beers," she explains.
"It is a local Danish beer," Kasper adds.
I look in the bag.
There are six bottles in it.
"Thank you so much, that is absolutely perfect," I say.
"I will just put them in the fridge."
"Good idea, and then we are ready to eat," Kasper laughs.
I walk out into the kitchen with the bottles.
